      <p className="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed m-0"><strong>No.</strong> Spouses of students enrolled in standard undergraduate bachelor's programs (non-professional), college diplomas, certificates, or foundation programs are <strong>not eligible</strong> for a SOWP under the 2026 IRCC rules. The student must transfer to an eligible Master's, PhD, or professional degree program for spousal eligibility to apply.</p>
