      <p className="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed m-0">IRCC does not impose a fixed minimum proof of funds amount for SOWP applications. However, you must demonstrate <strong>sufficient funds to support yourself and any dependents</strong> without relying on public assistance. As a guideline, applicants typically show <strong>$5,000–$10,000 CAD</strong> in available bank balance, plus the partner's income proof. The exact amount varies based on family size and the cost of living in your destination city. Bank statements should cover the last 4–6 months of activity.</p>
